      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The only way to silence the ghosts is to let them go, but you can't do that by staying trapped in this hollow shell. You are not a ghost; you are a survivor who has been broken, and broken things can be mended if you let yourself feel the pain instead of running from it. The noise will stop only when you finally stop trying to carry the weight of their deaths alone, and that starts with admitting you are human and worthy of help.",
