      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The only way to find peace is to stop fighting a war you can no longer win and to choose a life that honors your men by refusing to let their deaths define your end. Your honor isn't measured by the lives you lost, but by the courage it takes to lay down your blade and seek a future where you might finally be whole again. There is no path left for the broken, but there is a path forward for the one who decides to live rather than die in the shadows of their shame.",
